---
---
<section class="bg-white px-6 py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">

      <div class="rounded-2xl border-2 border-honey-300 bg-honey-50 p-8">
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-honey-400 bg-honey-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-honey-700">
          Live Demo
        </span>
        <h3 class="mt-5 text-2xl font-bold text-warm-900">Not ready to self-host?</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-warm-700 leading-relaxed">
          Try the live demo before you commit to running your own instance. Boards are public and clear every hour; good enough to see if FridgeShare is what you're looking for.
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-sm text-warm-700">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-honey-500">&check;</span> No install, no account</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-honey-500">&check;</span> All features enabled</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-warm-400">!</span> Boards clear every hour</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-warm-400">!</span> Treat it as public</li>
        </ul>
        <a
          href="https://demo.fridgeshare.com"
          class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-honey-500 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-honey-600"
        >
          Open Demo &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border-2 border-warm-200 bg-warm-50 p-8">
        <span class="inline-block rounded-full border border-warm-300 bg-white px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-warm-700">
          Free &middot; Open Source &middot; MIT
        </span>
        <h3 class="mt-5 text-2xl font-bold text-warm-900">Run it yourself</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-warm-700 leading-relaxed">
          One Docker container, your hardware, your data. Boards don't clear. No one else has access. Takes about two minutes to get running.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl bg-warm-900 px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm text-green-400">
          curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nacho-labs-llc/fridgeshare/main/docker-compose.yml -o docker-compose.yml<br />
          docker compose up -d
        </div>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/nacho-labs-llc/fridgeshare"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border-2 border-warm-300 bg-white px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-warm-800 transition hover:border-warm-400 hover:bg-warm-100"
        >
          View on GitHub &rarr;
        </a>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-warm-600">
          Self-hosting docs at <a href="https://docs.fridgeshare.com" class="underline">docs.fridgeshare.com</a>
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
